/* Localizable.strings — base language (Spanish)
   To add a new language: File → New → File → Strings File,
   name it "Localizable", select the target, then add the language
   from Project → Info → Localizations. Xcode creates the .lproj
   folder automatically. Only the values change; keys stay the same. */

